Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["BaselineComparison", "ObjectName",
 CellID->93941655,ExpressionUUID->"0e562ada-15ad-5241-851b-04c0ffe29f30"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"e99ac6d0-f18a-3749-b0ba-a096ea9f7ff9"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["BaselineComparison",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
BaselineComparison"], 
   RowBox[{"[", 
    RowBox[{"opts", ",", " ", "spec"}], "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"6d055677-36be-cc48-9021-cd475ea62d37"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "compares guided search, random-mutation search and exhaustive evaluation of \
the canonical rules of a signature at one evaluation budget."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->902476269,ExpressionUUID->"19acfa30-0edc-8547-9601-ba665d5d6aa6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every method starts from the same canonical seed with identical limits and \
no initial-state diagnostics, and gets 1 + Rounds*MutationBudget evaluations \
per run. Guided search adapts its strategy weights; random search keeps \
uniform weights over the same strategies; the exhaustive method evaluates \
canonical rules of the signature in enumeration order.",
 StyleBox["spec",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " keys: \"Seeds\" (random seeds), \"Signature\" (default: the seed rule's \
signature), \"MaxExhaustiveRules\" (10000), \"Methods\" and \"ConfidenceLevel\
\". Each method reports its success rate with a Wilson interval, evaluations \
to the first verified solution, solution counts, best objective values, \
compute cost and a \"Claim\" that states the signature, initial state, \
equivalence and limits and only what was measured."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->711052349,ExpressionUUID->"035c0b24-ac9b-5942-83ea-c1c3b4401b04"],

Cell["\<\
Registry membership is curated, so comparisons against Registry rules are not \
unbiased controls; this function provides the budget-matched baselines \
instead.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->508462167,ExpressionUUID->"9eac1a17-cb4d-fd4c-8aee-3103b780c9d4"]
}, Open  ]],

